5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","review_id":"tHlYeDIotJOPrJvz05StBA","date":"2021-12-10T17:05:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9291719794273376,"text_excerpt":"The selling point to the commons club is the super instagram-able decor and relaxed sweet staff. It's a bright, trendy series of small dining areas that each have their own living style. I could see using different areas for different events like brunch with a bestie or a celebration dinner with a large group. The drinks are also top notch! Both in taste and presentation. I had the Santa Fe Spa Water, a refreshing take on a Margarita. We also ordered a Dole Whip, a nod to the Disney favorite. The food was good, but not particularly outstanding. Brunch options include salads, soups, avocado toast, a burger, etc. We enjoyed everything but I wouldn't go back just for the food. The cocktails ..."},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","review_id":"-ndxRM6D6VbQS9oBntxaYg","date":"2021-12-04T21:44:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9246523380279541,"text_excerpt":"Not an extensive menu but what we had was top-notch. Had pappardelle with gulf shrimp and eggplant which was one of the best pasta dishes we have had in a restaurant recently. The smashed Waygu burger was great. Excellent wine list. Again not extensive but well sourced. Excellent service. Beautiful restaurant and lobby."},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","review_id":"tjXp2NeNetnovdgcvYnJZQ","date":"2021-08-26T19:37:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9209048748016357,"text_excerpt":"Wow oh wow! This place exceeded all my expectations. The bar is gorgeous. The decorations in the area are quite extraordinary yet simple. The rabbit theme is adorable at the hotel and pet friendly. The rooftop pool is AMAZING! I am just waiting for NOLA to realize this gem and expect a wait. It was so simple to get in. I ordered a French 75 and it was great. I will go back for dinner. My girls need a night out there."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","photo_id":"ZZHBW4qEGLZx4-TguxqQbA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ZZHBW4qEGLZx4-TguxqQbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8636237382888794},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","photo_id":"cuF2LtuESVfzm7sX6j5stA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cuF2LtuESVfzm7sX6j5stA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8189954161643982},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","photo_id":"n7VZhCmEBxwFhyS59pV5GQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/n7VZhCmEBxwFhyS59pV5GQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8155646324157715},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","photo_id":"BHkfQZSjxjmWC7Vqq_p2Cw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BHkfQZSjxjmWC7Vqq_p2Cw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8081883192062378},{"business_id":"rrd9QThX5G728RprMsxcGA","photo_id":"Vw792BTTO-_MoQNuGqMQUw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Vw792BTTO-_MoQNuGqMQUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.649994432926178}]},"notebook_case":null}
